# Editor scripts

- **`GlobalDomination.Editor.asmdef`**: Editor platform only; references **Assembly-CSharp**. New editor types that must inspect runtime types belong here or in another Editor asmdef that references the right assemblies.
- Guard runtime usage of editor APIs with `#if UNITY_EDITOR` when sharing helpers; **do not** ship editor-only code outside `#if UNITY_EDITOR` in runtime assemblies if it pulls in `UnityEditor`.
- Prefer **CustomEditor** / **PropertyDrawer** next to the runtime type under `.../Editor/` or `Scripts/Editor/` consistent with existing `UITestManagerEditor.cs`, `DiceMaterialUpgrader.cs`.
